30,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes over an hour and a half. Also, outside firms require us to tidy up before they even arrive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's not even! Some of us are barely here, and only a few people actually make the kitchen a mess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Our chat history is full of reminders that lead to fights. The previous tenants tried permanent rooms and stopped speaking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"We're wasting money buying the same spray twice! Also, the management office cleaner is 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We all have different ideas of ""clean."" And the bathroom grout gets dirty again in just eleven days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, if the grout is that bad, a simple rota might not be enough to keep it sanitary.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if permanent rooms make people stop talking, we definitely shouldn't do that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. We need a solution that doesn't leave one person feeling burdened or resentful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But who pays for the soap? If we hire someone, we need a clear way to split the bill.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just don't want to walk into a surprise mess. A rota might not stop the inconsistency.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, the management office billing goes to one person. That could be a point of conflict if not handled.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If only a few of us use the kitchen, maybe those people should do more of the work?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that sounds like a recipe for more arguments in the house chat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,I just want to make sure nobody is out of pocket for the sponges and bags.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we can't agree on what ""done"" means, any rota will just lead to fights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,It seems the time commitment is significant. We need to decide if we value our time or our money more.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I still think a rota is better than permanent rooms, but it has to be fair.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I'm leaning toward a professional service to remove the friction entirely.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Rin,,"As long as the billing is transparent, I'm okay with a professional.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"A professional would probably have a standard for ""clean"" that we all have to follow.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
