55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is too risky for our relationships. Option B is a lot of unpaid labor. Option C is efficient.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I like B because it's traditional, but A is definitely out after what Victoria found.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Victoria,,I strongly vote for C. It's the only way to ensure we stay on speaking terms.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,C sounds great if we just split the invoice monthly. No more guessing who paid for bleach!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I vote C. I'd rather pay to know the bathroom is actually clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The time saved is worth the cost. I vote C.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if everyone else wants C, I'll go with it. I don't want to be the odd one out.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate that, Mio. It's better for the house.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! Professional cleaners! I vote C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,Me too. C.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
